[116] indent=2 block=359dbe27 H2
      "2026-05-07 - NRG product prioritization" {b fg=#337ea9}
[117] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "[unsupported block]" {i fg=#9b9a97}
[118] indent=8 block=359dbe27
[119] indent=10 block=359dbe27
[120] indent=0 block=-
[121] indent=8 block=359dbe27
[122] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "Cool. Notion AI is transcribing this meeting. Okay."
[123] indent=0 block=-
[124] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "So that's, oops. What just happened? What is going on? Oh my "
[125] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "god. Okay."
[126] indent=0 block=-
[127] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "Cool. I pulled up all of the projects in Linear and actually "
[128] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "let's just like start with Spock just to like go over all of "
[129] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "them um all of the in-flight work but that that is like sort "
[130] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "of not winning dart i guess um i mean we we're considering "
[131] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "spec trading winning dart but like it's not really um so i "
[132] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "sent christobal the message in the spec trading slack let me "
[133] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "make sure you're You're in there too. Okay, what you are."
[134] indent=0 block=-
[135] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "It's not really much product work left, so I figured the "
[136] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "handoff to Cristobal made more sense for this one "
[137] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "specifically. It's just coordinating the NRG testing and "
[138] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "release. And I feel like it's going to be a... Like I bet what"
[139] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "will happen is it ends up being The third week of May, like I "
[140] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "bought everything will be ready to go sometime the 18th plus. "
[141] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "And I would push for no later, like closing this project out "
[142] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "by the 29th. Um, cause that'll be sort of a month after we "
[143] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "intended to do everything."
[144] indent=0 block=-
[145] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "So yeah, this should all wrap up. Did you have any like "
[146] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "questions or concerns with this one?"
[147] indent=0 block=-
[148] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "My only thought on communication to NRG, well, just wanted to "
[149] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "get your thoughts. Do you think... Like, do we want to show "
[150] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "back tests and stuff? I guess my only concern is I was looking"
[151] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "at the TSRB and the back tests. We do so much worse with this "
[152] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "update."
[153] indent=0 block=-
[154] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "I think that we phrase it more as a scale I think we should "
[155] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "frame it as like, We've been monitoring the strategy in shadow"
[156] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "mode and we added some additional risk mitigation parameters. "
[157] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "We want to scale it live so we don't want to go live with the "
[158] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "full thing just to ensure that we don't have any big lost days"
[159] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "like what we saw on April, whatever that was. I think that's "
[160] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "the right framing. What do you think?"
[161] indent=0 block=-
[162] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "Okay. So that makes it kind of sound like it's temporary. Is "
[163] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "it temporary? Maybe I haven't been."
[164] indent=0 block=-
[165] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "It is. So the goal is actually to scale it to the 250. Um..."
[166] indent=0 block=-
[167] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "Sorry, I know the spec volume, but there's the-Is the like... "
[168] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "whatever spike Oh. Is that temporary? That like penalization "
[169] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "of spike risk. I think it is."
[170] indent=0 block=-
[171] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "And maybe we do need to talk a little bit about that "
[172] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "specifically. And that's sort of part of the scaling is like "
[173] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "right now we have this, um, like risk mitigation measure in "
[174] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "place until we have the next version of our forecast models is"
[175] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "I think framing. Yeah. Cause like basically the problem is "
[176] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "that we don't, a, we don't trust or we don't have full "
[177] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "confidence in our forecast on a day-to-day basis. And then B "
[178] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "we're overexposed to the MEC."
[179] indent=0 block=-
[180] indent=10 block=359dbe27
