      "Sean is going to do the technical design and the product. Like"
[476] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "the product role here is one ensuring that The strategy team, "
[477] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "who are sort of the users in the SMEs of this have "
[478] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "communicated like the experience that they're looking for and "
[479] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "then the product person translates that into what we want to "
[480] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "build and then Sean designs the technical design for that "
[481] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "build. I have the jobs to be done here and I did have cloud "
[482] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "make issues."
[483] indent=0 block=-
[484] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "I haven't reviewed them or audited them yet. So I need to do "
[485] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "that before having Kyle and John review it. And then it would "
[486] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "be, I do think we need to have some level of TSRB on. this "
[487] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "type of strategy I don't know, like... whatever, I don't even "
[488] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "know what to call it, type of strategy. with NRG. And so I "
[489] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "think Cristobal would play that role there with the strategy "
[490] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "team. And then Sam, I think like, this can evolve into a core "
[491] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "feature of our platform."
[492] indent=0 block=-
[493] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "Yeah. Cool."
[494] indent=0 block=-
[495] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "Yeah, to that end, Like this one seems quite meaty. It's "
[496] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "massive. a lot of other stuff to do. Like, is there, has "
[497] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "anyone done any sizing of like the,Not yet. Values to be "
[498] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "captured here. I guess it's like a little bit ambiguous 'cause"
[499] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "we don't really have other strategies to be selected. Right "
[500] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "now, so it's like kind of building towards that."
[501] indent=0 block=-
[502] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "Well, I want them to start just with the optimized and "
[503] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "baseline. Because right now, when we tell NRG, like, this just"
[504] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "happened last week. Like, hey, tomorrow's looking really "
[505] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "risky. We just lost $500,000. Like, we don't want to submit a "
[506] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "strategy tomorrow. They don't actually use the baseline "
[507] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "orders. Like, they don't care about our baseline orders. They "
[508] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "then have their desk manage the volume that we manage."
[509] indent=0 block=-
[510] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "And so instead of having to be like, oh, like, hours 18 to 19 "
[511] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "look so risky that we don't want to operate at all, we would "
[512] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "want to just mix the, Optimize strategy with like 18 to 19 "
[513] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "with baseline. So I think that's the start simple but I do "
[514] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "agree that this could spin out of control really easily and so"
[515] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "that's another like thing that you guys should help manage."
[516] indent=0 block=-
[517] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "This is why I want Roman. running with this one in the near "
[518] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "term largely because I think he's good at keeping stuff "
[519] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "efficient enough that it gets done and doesn't run away. And "
[520] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "then if it does turn into more, like that's for the internal, "
[521] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "like solve this for our internal operators, strategy "
[522] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "operators. Yeah. And then if it does turn into more of a "
[523] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "product feature, then on application, then yeah, Sam, we can "
[524] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "engage with you."
[525] indent=0 block=-
[526] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "And if there's stuff that goes to energy, obviously Cristobal,"
[527] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "but I feel like because of the ambiguity, I want Roman to help"
[528] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "make sure this doesn't explode."
[529] indent=0 block=-
[530] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "100%. Yeah, I think it starts with Roman and gets handed off. "
[531] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "Or like, I do want Sam and Roman to stay in touch on like what"
[532] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "we're building. And just because Sam will have like,Sam's "
[533] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "customers or users are our EQ strategist, Kyle, John, Raphael,"
[534] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "Steve, and the Gunverse strategists. And so I think like "
[535] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "though they make up the user requirements and sort of like "
[536] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "personas that we're building this for. But Roman taking the "
[537] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "first start simple SOBs totally makes sense."
[538] indent=0 block=-
[539] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "Oh."
[540] indent=0 block=-
[541] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "I can't tell, am I next? Yeah, you are. Can we... Okay, so "
[542] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "timing of this. Could we hold off for a few weeks on starting "
[543] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "to scope it out until spec trading is done and Josh has done "
[544] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "the snapshot order stuff?"
[545] indent=0 block=-
[546] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "The snapshot orders can be in parallel if Sean is driving "
[547] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "that, but I agree that holding off, I think the next sprint "
[548] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "should be Roman confirming scope and tickets for, and Sean "
[549] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "maybe starting to think about the technical design, but "
[550] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "then... There should be a project kickoff for this in about a "
[551] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "sprint or so."
[552] indent=0 block=-
[553] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "Can I poke at that a little bit? Because didn't you want Sean "
[554] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "to do the timing thing?"
[555] indent=0 block=-
[556] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "Yes, but I feel like that's easy. Like I think that's like..."
[557] indent=0 block=-
[558] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "Three or four doesn't work. Yeah. That's fair, but I think "
[559] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "what I'm trying to do is we're As we looked at yesterday, we "
[560] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "have too many things going on. Like, could we say just not yet"
[561] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "for two weeks? Or will that really hurt us for two weeks?"
[562] indent=0 block=-
[563] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "I don't think it really hurts us. Let's just set the "
[564] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "expectations with the strategy team and make sure I'm not "
[565] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "missing anything. I can send that note. Ah. What's... Or do "
[566] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "you mean who's going to do the other order visit the this?"
[567] indent=0 block=-
[568] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "Yeah, sorry. Who's not what?"
[569] indent=0 block=-
[570] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "I think that's mostly Matt."
[571] indent=0 block=-
[572] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "Okay, so they're not. Yeah."
[573] indent=0 block=-
[574] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "Okay. I think this is Matt, but it's a good question. We're "
[575] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "like, yes, the tabs are in order of how I think the work "
[576] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "should be sequenced and therefore it would be on. Lydia to "
[577] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "help us like determine who and when and so if Until everything"
[578] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "before this tab is done, it's okay to hold off on doing this "
[579] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "one. But I will confirm that with the strategy team today. "
[580] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "Um... Where did that TSRB thing just go? Did anyone notice I "
[581] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "created it and then it disappeared?"
[582] indent=0 block=-
[583] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "You might've made it an update."
[584] indent=0 block=-
[585] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "Oh, did I? Shit."
[586] indent=0 block=-
[587] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "Yeah, you're right, I did. Sorry, I'm not good at this yet. "
[588] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "I'm trying to get good at it, but it's taking me some time. "
[589] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "The learning curve is curving."
[590] indent=0 block=-
[591] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "I have to leave a meeting that I joined rudely late."
[592] indent=0 block=-
[593] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "No worries, we're continuing to record and I have to hop "
[594] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "shortly here too."
[595] indent=0 block=-
[596] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "You said you're going to talk to Roman, Carolyn?"
[597] indent=0 block=-
[598] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "Yeah, I am. All right."
[599] indent=0 block=-
[600] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "Thanks all."
[601] indent=0 block=-
[602] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "And honestly, that was pretty much everything. Like that was "
[603] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "the prioritization and handoff I guess two so two for one um "
[604] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "And yeah, I guess we can wrap up unless there's additional "
[605] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "questions or comments. I'll figure out where that TSRB thing "
[606] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "went. I think that that doesn't necessarily need to be a "
[607] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "blocker for anything or like you could start figuring out what"
[608] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "a TSRB like that even looks like earlier than later, "
[609] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "Cristobal, with the strategy team."
[610] indent=0 block=-
[611] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "Because it is a new type of approval that we're seeking. I'll "
[612] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "find that ticket and assign it to you or whatever I did. Cool."
[613] indent=10 block=359dbe27
      "Thank you guys. Talk to you later. Bye. See you."
